1
00:00:00,960 --> 00:00:05,760
Meet me at the Randy's Donut
by the airport at 2:00 a.m.

2
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:11,060
(Sheldon:)What is that you're eating?

3
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,800
(Sheldon:)Tonight is pizza night.

4
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:16,070
(Leonard:)I'd like to refer that
to my attorney.

5
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:19,040
(Priya:)According to what I see here,

6
00:00:19,040 --> 00:00:21,140
(Priya:)Thursday nights
are Franconi's pizza night.

7
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:23,680
(Sheldon:)Yes, and when Franconi's
went out of business,

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,750
(Sheldon:)we switched to Graziano's.

9
00:00:25,750 --> 00:00:27,030
(Howard:)That's interesting.

10
00:00:27,030 --> 00:00:30,820
(Howard:)Can you just switch
restaurants like that, Priya?

11
00:00:32,250 --> 00:00:34,120
(Priya:)A good question, Howard.

12
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,490
(Priya:)Turns out you can't.

13
00:00:36,490 --> 00:00:37,820
(Sheldon:)According to
the document

14
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,690
(Priya:)you drew up, Sheldon,
the selection

15
00:00:39,690 --> 00:00:42,130
(Priya:)of a new takeout restaurant
requires public hearings

16
00:00:42,130 --> 00:00:44,210
(Priya:)and a 60-day comment period.

17
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:46,270
(Priya:)Were those criteria met?

18
00:00:52,710 --> 00:00:54,910
(Sheldon:)No.

19
00:00:55,610 --> 00:00:59,020
Opa! Opa!
Opa!

